	(text "NOTES:\n\n  - J9 and J11 support 3-wire fans only: \n      1 GND\n      2 independently switched +12 V\n      3 open-collector tach. \n\n  - Q1/Q2 and Q3/Q4 implement high-side supply PWM\n\n  - J12: External DS18B20 temp probe; with 4.7k pullup on data\n      1 GND\n      2 DQ\n      3 +3V3\n\nTODO:\n  - [ ] validate PWM, startup, stall, tach, and combined 12 V rail loading\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
